// FALLBACK DEPLOY METHOD — Cloudflare Workers static assets.
// Only needed if Cloudflare Pages is unavailable to you. To use it:
//   1. Rename this file to wrangler.jsonc (keeping it in rf-chamber-site/).
//   2. From rf-chamber-site/, run:  npx wrangler deploy
// The site will be served from a *.workers.dev URL (free tier).
//
// NOTE: Keep this file under its fallback name while using Cloudflare Pages
// Direct Upload, so `wrangler pages deploy` isn't confused by a Workers config.
//
// Other free alternatives: GitHub Pages, or Netlify's drag-and-drop deploy
// (drop the public/ folder at https://app.netlify.com/drop).
{
  "name": "rf-chamber-rental",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-07-01",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./public"
  }
}
